        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "loc_tian_ti"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the five great regions, since ancient times till now, the greatest Gu Immortal organisation was only the Heavenly Court. Chapter 468 also records the Court as too high for a Southern Border immortal to steer, and shows it taking all the recipes from Lang Ya blessed land after it acts.",
      "chapters": [
        468
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
