      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_heavenly_court_final_war"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Its resolve also carries a chapter title.",
      "chapters": [
        2332
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-final-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The published text stops in the middle of that war. Chapter 2333 is titled “Three Venerables Attack Heavenly Court!”.",
      "chapters": [
        2333
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-final-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 2334, the last chapter there is, breaks off with Fang Yuan and Giant Sun fighting Star Constellation.",
